Description: Estimate conditional treatment effects in randomized trials using
    external outcome predictions calibrated within randomized treatment arms.
    Provides matched-covariate, single-arm, imputation, and linear partial
    least squares recipes, grouped cross-fitting, conditional trial bootstrap
    inference, and held-out prediction diagnostics. Retains the original
    linear R-OSCAR engine of Asiaee and colleagues <arXiv:2306.17478>.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: glmnet, methods, stats, utils, graphics, grDevices, splines
